# Latency A/B arms for deploy/ghost-arms.sh. Each arm adds one change to the one
# before it, so each step's gain reads off directly; the most important come first
# in case the job is preempted. Flags are documented in .env.example.
# C and E used hand-raise flags that the Think & Action floor no longer reads, and D
# and E drafted ahead from the host's canned intro, which Think & Action doesn't play,
# so C, D and E now match B; the arm names are kept for comparison with old runs.
A
B TALKSHOW_PRERENDER_CANNED=1
C TALKSHOW_PRERENDER_CANNED=1
D TALKSHOW_PRERENDER_CANNED=1
E TALKSHOW_PRERENDER_CANNED=1
